@startuml Seq_Register
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequence diagram --- Register

actor Visitor
participant "Register page\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "Server" as S
database "SQLite" as DB

Visitor -> UI : Opens /register and submits the form
UI -> S : POST /api/auth/register
S -> DB : Create User
DB --> S : User saved
S --> UI : Session cookie
UI --> Visitor : Redirect to /dashboard
@enduml
